      "note_tweet": {
        "text": "A long note about evaluation harnesses for coding agents. The short version: measure the task, not the model.\n\nFirst, keep a fixed set of tasks from your own repositories. Second, run each agent three times, because the results vary. Third, record the cost of each run next to the pass rate. Fourth, read the failed transcripts by hand every week.\n\nDetails and the scripts: https://t.co/HaRnEsS777",
